        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-variance",
        "moduleId": "independence-variance",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "方差、标准差与两两独立时的可加性",
        "markdown": "随机变量与期望之差的平方的加权平均值称为方差，记作 $\\operatorname{Var}[X]$，计算公式为\n\n$$\\operatorname{Var}[X]=\\operatorname{E}\\big[(X-\\operatorname{E}[X])^{2}\\big]=\\operatorname{E}[X^{2}]-(\\operatorname{E}[X])^{2}$$\n\n总有 $\\operatorname{E}[X^{2}]\\ge(\\operatorname{E}[X])^{2}$。方差的平方根叫做标准差，记作 $\\sigma=\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Var}[X]}$。如果随机变量 $X_1,X_2,\\dots,X_n$ 两两独立，则\n\n$$\\operatorname{Var}\\Big[\\sum_{i=1}^{n}X_i\\Big]=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\operatorname{Var}[X_i]$$\n\n教材把这一可加性结论称为切比雪夫不等式。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
